// {R} 1/1: "{T}: copy target activated or triggered ability." Modeled on the
// tap-pinger shape (Creature tap-activated DealDamage AnyTarget.ron) and the
// spell-copier fixture, but targeting `Kind(Ability)` ([CR#109.1]) instead of
// `Kind(Spell)` — `Kind(Spell)` does NOT match an ability on the stack (an
// activated/triggered ability has no card identity of its own), so the
// spell-copier fixture cannot reach one. The engine-copy-spells fixture for
// `ability_copy_same_source_resolves_and_vanishes` ([CR#707.10b]).
Normal(
    name: "Creature tap-activated CopySpell Target Ability",
    mana_cost: [Red],
    types: [Creature],
    power: 1,
    toughness: 1,
    abilities: [
        Activated(cost: [Tap], effect: Targeted(targets: [TargetOne(Kind(Ability))], effect: CopySpell(controller: You, spec: (source: Object(Target(0))), retarget: AsIs))),
    ],
)
